      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A word for a kind of place, or a brand, is searched inside a circle: 10 km, widened once to 25 km, never beyond. Nothing from outside the circle is added. Every provider call spends the limits (P011f1, ADR 0018)",
